        "TileImage": "$($repository 9b0d0651-4f81-40e5-bf2a-5aec6fd763a5).Image",
        "Description": "Good day 47, and welcome back to Miami, USA. Three dangerous criminals who killed and robbed  in the eastern United States in th 2000s resurfaced after more than 20 years hiding and travelling around the world. Living with new identities and stolen money, they are now revealing their shadows at the crime scene during a rally event. Our client recognized them and requested to eliminate them forever and for revenge. Good luck 47, and as always... Have fun!",
